  "formal_statement": "theorem CollatzWork.affineRecurrenceTelescope (a b : Nat) (y : Nat \u2192 Nat) (k : Nat)\n    (h : \u2200 i, i < k \u2192 b * y (i + 1) = a * y i) :\n    b ^ k * y k = a ^ k * y 0 := by sorry\n\n",
